      "## Species trait data We quantified the functional niche occupied by each species based on three morphometric traits that reflect their food resources: body length, mandible length, and width between mandibles at their base (Deroulers and Bretagnolle 2019) and two traits that reflect their dispersal ability: rear leg length and wing type.",
